          "name": "account_get-context",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:9cd7ad40e2b9c51b0d52163b4178588958021d483bce1247a4530425b44ff52e",
          "description": "Read who is signed in and which sync. organization this session runs in (paid work is created and billed there), with its plan, generation limits, feature flags, and team seat and voice-clone limits. Use it to name the organization before paid work or to check limits before planning a job; for credits, balance or spend use account_get-usage, and to list or switch organizations use organizations_list or organizations_select. account is null with an API key. limits, plan, generationLimits and features are omitted when their lookup fails, while an expired sign-in returns an error. organizationChoice says whether the organization came from organizations_select or the credential",
