          "description": "Rename one existing project you can access in the current organization; only the name changes, while visibility, owner, media and generations stay as they are. Use it only when the user explicitly asks to rename that project, never because its name or workflow matches the request or its editor is open; new work gets a new project from projects_create instead. Always pass projectIntent=explicit, including for a project you just created for this request; a rename without it can be refused with PROJECT_INTENT_REQUIRED. A missing, deleted or inaccessible project returns a 404 error. Returns the project",
